# Vectors of tests/data/sst68040_fpu on which the fork deliberately does not
# follow the oracle: one name per line, grouped by ruling
# (oracle/fuzz/disputes/NOTES.md). `sst68040 --known` counts a listed vector
# that fails apart, and FAILS on one that passes or is missing: when a ruling
# is settled, its block leaves this file in the same change.

